WEBVTT

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:27.310
<b>Dr. Ramune
Mysterious Disease Specialist</b>

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:32.660
<i>Ever since I was little,</i>

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:36.160
<i>I've been able to see things 
ordinary people can't.</i>

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:45.240
<i>The weird things are gone.</i>

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.830
<i>What's this? His stomach, huh?</i>

00:01:47.830 --> 00:01:49.750
<i>Looks pretty bad.</i>

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:50.870
I'll join your group.

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:56.710
I shall perform a special cleansing 
to exorcise your impurities.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:01.720
<b>Episode 11 - "Toru's Deeply Mysterious Story - Part Two"</b>

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:08.460
<i>This cloth will cover up the truth 
with lies, but it comes at a price.</i>

00:02:09.490 --> 00:02:11.210
<i>I've got ten minutes.</i>

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.110
Hey.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:17.730
Sir.

00:02:17.970 --> 00:02:22.450
Uh, how's that small boy doing?

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.510
His fasting is going well.

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.370
I believe today is his third day.

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.990
<i>What? That idiot.</i>

00:02:28.990 --> 00:02:31.560
<i>He already wasn't eating properly.</i>

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.520
I actually need to speak with the boy.

00:02:34.520 --> 00:02:36.470
Where's the key?

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:47.940
<i>You require greater spiritual training.</i>

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:53.290
<i>Once this is over, you'll be 
freed from all suffering.</i>

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:58.450
<i>You require greater spiritual training.</i>

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:58.130
Kid, let's get outta here!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.570
<i>Once this is over, you'll be—</i>

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:05.360
You idiot. You shouldn't be fasting!

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:07.130
Why are you here?

00:03:07.130 --> 00:03:09.220
I'll explain later, now c'mon!

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:10.290
Please let go of me.

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:11.280
Huh?

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:13.860
This is my training.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.300
He said this would make me better.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:19.590
You still trust a guy who makes you do this?

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:22.590
Shut up.

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:23.720
You need to get away from—

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:24.660
Stop bothering me!

00:03:33.070 --> 00:03:34.950
Open your eyes already!

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:35.850
Do you want to die?!

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:39.680
What you choose to believe is up to you,

00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.200
but none of that crap matters if you're <i>dead!</i>

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.450
Sorry for yelling.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:49.310
You think I'll die?

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:51.020
Why?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:56.600
Take a look at your stomach.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:05.190
You know what'll happen if 
this continues, don't you?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.870
I thought I'd finally be cured, though...

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:17.590
You've been struggling with not 
being understood by anyone, right?

00:04:18.670 --> 00:04:21.010
You were so desperate,
you were clutching at straws.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.270
I know exactly how you feel.

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:28.020
Is it so wrong for me to want to help you?

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:33.680
If you don't know what to 
believe, then believe in me.

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.000
If you try anything, I'm calling
 the cops immediately.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.810
Huh? Uh, sure.

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:47.160
It seems like you're the 
one who's about to die.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:50.810
I'm totally fine.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:54.330
What happened to your face?

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.680
Huh? Oh, this?

00:04:57.990 --> 00:05:00.840
Just a scratch. Don't worry about it.

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:04.740
<i>They're gone.</i>

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:11.200
This is the shrine I...

00:05:11.640 --> 00:05:14.060
It's my shrine.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.750
You're lying.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.700
Huh?! Why would you say that?

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:24.560
<i>The strange things vanished 
because I came to this shrine.</i>

00:05:25.900 --> 00:05:29.850
<i>It wasn't because he exorcised me.</i>

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:33.340
Kid, food's ready.

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:35.390
Here, have some porridge.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.580
You don't want an empty stomach.

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.530
This'll have to do for today.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.850
<b>Crab Claw</b>

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:44.600
What's wrong? You're not going to eat?

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:47.480
I throw up everything I eat.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:49.480
You'll be fine. Try it.

00:06:13.360 --> 00:06:16.830
I don't feel nauseous. Why not?

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:20.180
You're asking why? You didn't 
throw up those rice balls, either.

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.600
I made them so you wouldn't.

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.430
Rice balls?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.590
<i>Oh, those...</i>

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:30.180
<i>He's right. I didn't throw up.</i>

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:34.360
I made some pork miso udon, too.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.580
<i>He's the one who made them.</i>

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:38.450
Um—

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:38.450
So, anyway!

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:42.700
Since I'm perfectly healthy, 
I'll be eating this katsudon!

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:51.150
So good...

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:57.020
Once your stomach is better, 
you'll be able to eat this, too.

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.690
Will I get better?

00:06:59.690 --> 00:07:04.120
Your stomach will, but I can't 
cure your ability to see things.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.840
You were born that way.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:13.000
You can see those weird 
things, too, can't you?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.150
What are they?

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:18.290
They're called the "mysterious."

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:23.230
They mess with people and objects, 
causing strange phenomena.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:28.680
They're thought to be former deities who
 have fallen due to a decline in believers.

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:31.930
People whose bloodlines 
were closely associated

00:07:31.930 --> 00:07:34.610
with the mysterious still 
have the power to see them.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:41.010
You and I probably have ancestors 
who could see them, too.

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:43.260
What a nuisance.

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:46.930
<i>I see.</i>

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.260
<i>So it wasn't an illness that 
was making me see them.</i>

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:04.090
<i>Hello?</i>

00:08:04.940 --> 00:08:07.320
Hello, uh...

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:10.470
<i>Come to think of it, I forgot 
to ask him for his name.</i>

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.020
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

00:08:12.390 --> 00:08:14.200
I have your son.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:14.850
<i>What?</i>

00:08:15.320 --> 00:08:18.360
<i>Crap. Now I sound like a kidnapper.</i>

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:36.930
Good morning, kid!

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.460
Did you sleep well?

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.490
Your hair makes you look like an alien!

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:44.490
<i>Oh, right.</i>

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:48.270
Spineless Sea Urchin

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:47.980
You should be able to eat better 
than you could yesterday.

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:51.940
Thanks for the food.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.340
And I'll be eating this Korean BBQ bowl!

00:08:56.230 --> 00:09:00.860
So good. I'm in heaven.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.490
<i>What a childish adult.</i>

00:09:03.490 --> 00:09:07.010
Oh, right. I called your house yesterday.

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:08.490
They must be worried.

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:12.540
I don't think they'd be worried.

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.370
What? What makes you say that?

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:16.580
I told them I'd be at a study camp,

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:20.650
and besides, they trust me.

00:09:21.090 --> 00:09:22.530
Trust you?

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.850
You haven't told your family 
that you can see things?

00:09:27.110 --> 00:09:27.980
No.

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:35.450
You said eating makes you throw up,
 but that's not accurate, is it?

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:36.680
You cough strange stuff up, right?

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:42.350
Instead of being digested, the foreign 
substances you've swallowed come back up.

00:09:43.780 --> 00:09:47.550
I haven't swallowed anything, though...

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:50.680
You've been swallowing your words.

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.340
You wanted to talk about 
the mysterious, but couldn't.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:58.540
You were swallowing the mysterious 
along with your words.

00:09:59.900 --> 00:10:06.070
In short, your stomach is 
like a very active volcano.

00:10:06.470 --> 00:10:09.370
The mysterious and the stress you swallow 
accumulates in your stomach,

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.530
and once it exceeds a certain level, kaboom.

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:16.580
That's why you can't stop throwing up 
and why you can't eat anything.

00:10:16.820 --> 00:10:18.540
So, what will you do now?

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:23.190
At this rate, it'll keep getting worse.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.170
You'll never be able to eat again.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:28.860
To recover, you need to act on 
the stress causing all this.

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:30.570
The stress...

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:34.870
You could tell me about the 
mysterious, but that's not it.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:37.110
It can't be just anybody.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:42.870
There are specific people you want 
to be understood by, aren't there?

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:49.570
Yes.

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:56.120
All right. In that case, 
let's go to your house.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.010
<b>Manumerous</b>

00:11:02.020 --> 00:11:04.510
Who let that brat go?!

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.020
He's a student at a 
prestigious private school.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:10.550
Many graduates are big names
in political and economic circles.

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.740
If things go well, we could 
establish lucrative connections.

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:14.140
We're going to get him back.

00:11:14.360 --> 00:11:18.720
I'll brainwash his entire family.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.200
<b>Kuromori Dojo</b>

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:27.450
I'm home.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:35.320
<b>Kuromori Dojo</b>

00:11:28.210 --> 00:11:30.810
Toru, you're back.

00:11:30.810 --> 00:11:33.200
And this guy must be your kidnapper!

00:11:33.200 --> 00:11:35.320
You caught your own kidnapper!

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:36.760
Huh?

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.110
What kind of phone call did you make?

00:11:39.110 --> 00:11:41.330
A very <i>normal</i> one!

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.320
He said, "I have your son."

00:11:43.320 --> 00:11:45.550
What are you, a master of misunderstandings?

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:49.690
Guys, this man is a doctor 
and not a suspicious person.

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:51.980
I think. Probably...

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:52.780
Hey!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.100
A doctor? This guy?

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.660
Toru, are you sick?

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:01.530
There's something I want to tell you guys.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:17.840
The truth is, I was born with the 
ability to see strange things.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.760
Um, right now,

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:31.050
there's a bunch of strangely-shaped 
objects floating around here.

00:12:31.690 --> 00:12:34.390
Wha? Toru, what are you talking about?

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:36.690
Are you okay? There's nothing there.

00:12:37.260 --> 00:12:38.660
There's nothing there.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.070
There is, though. Right here.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.370
Look closely.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:49.680
Come to think of it, you said the same 
thing when you were little, but...

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:52.240
I don't see anything.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:58.180
He said that because he didn't 
want you guys to worry.

00:12:58.180 --> 00:13:00.540
You're supposed to be his family. 
Why don't you get that?

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:03.270
What was that?

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:06.070
Toru, why are you lying?

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:08.060
What kind of ideas has he 
been putting in your head?

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:10.120
I'm not ly—

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:11.440
Your study camp.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:15.160
When I asked one of your classmates about 
it, they said there was no study camp.

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:16.570
You lied about that, didn't you?

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:18.430
What? Is that true, Toru?

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:22.820
I kept my mouth shut because I trusted you.

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:28.080
<i>It's no use. I shouldn't make
 them worry anymore.</i>

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.270
Trusted him, my ass.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:35.850
Don't you think he's shouldering this burden 
alone because his family is like this?

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:36.570
What?

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:40.500
Wait! He's not a bad person. I think...

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.140
Hey!

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:43.390
I made all of that up.

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:45.380
What are you talking about?!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.090
Tell them the truth!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:51.620
Don't you get what will happen to you
 if you keep swallowing your words?

00:13:55.220 --> 00:13:58.820
It's fine...

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.070
It's <i>not</i> fine!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.600
You treat yourself worse 
than anyone else does!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:07.310
Asshole!

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:08.500
What are you doing to Toru?

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.530
Katsudon!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:14.160
Korean BBQ! Sukiyaki! Pot 
stickers! Tonkotsu ramen!

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:17.350
Are you okay with never eating those again?

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.410
Every day!

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:22.070
Every day, I'll eat tasty foods 
right in front of your face!

00:14:22.070 --> 00:14:26.130
You won't be able to stand 
how jealous you'll be!

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:33.420
So you <i>were</i> eating those 
things just to annoy me.

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:34.800
Shut up.

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:39.130
"I'm at a loss"

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:39.510
Spineless Sea Urchin

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:39.520
I hate to admit it, but they did look good.

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:43.360
It's disgraceful to be so gluttonous.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:45.510
Why? There's nothing wrong with it.

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.860
At times like this, instead of worrying 
about what's convenient for others,

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:51.030
you should be true to yourself.

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:55.000
Is that right? In that case...

00:14:57.610 --> 00:15:00.540
I want to eat them all!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:02.930
Well said!

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.690
Kurage-nii, I'm sorry.

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:09.410
I'm sorry, everyone!

00:15:09.410 --> 00:15:13.770
I lied about the study camp,
but it's true that I can see things!

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.970
Please believe me!

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:20.390
I understand, Toru.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:28.970
Hey!

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:31.560
Are you okay?

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.770
Toru, I'm sad.

00:15:33.230 --> 00:15:36.770
<b>The strong prey on the strong</b>

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:40.530
You've turned into a bad kid 
who lies with a straight face.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:42.400
But I haven't changed—

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:46.370
Toru, you never wore such 
tasteless clothes before!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:50.000
Spineless Sea Urchin

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:50.000
"I'm at a loss"

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:49.140
It proves that you've changed!

00:15:51.160 --> 00:15:54.320
No, wait. This was an accident.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.000
Tasteless?

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:59.250
He's right! You've been 
acting strange recently!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:15:59.700
Yeah!

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:02.140
And you've been worried about 
something for a while.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:04.520
It was all your fault, wasn't it?

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:06.280
Kurage.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:08.550
Get rid of him!

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:10.850
You should be able to handle him yourself!

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:13.030
Of course.

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:17.740
Hey, are you doing okay mentally?

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:19.110
I'm fine.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:25.380
If anything, I'm starting to get angry 
that they still refuse to believe me.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:27.470
Glad to hear it.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:32.080
I have a plan.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:36.590
Can you immobilize him? 
Just one second will do.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.690
If I stop him, you'll do 
something about this, right?

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.350
I'm trusting you.

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.680
You can count on me.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.190
Toru, you're in the way.

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:55.580
I won't let you touch him.

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:56.950
I'll take you on!

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:02.340
Even though you've never beaten me?

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.150
Come on, Toru.

00:17:15.940 --> 00:17:17.600
It's time to give up.

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.310
<i>You were clutching at straws.</i>

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.270
<i>It can't be just anybody.</i>

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.790
<i>It's not fine!</i>

00:17:25.490 --> 00:17:26.890
<i>Just for a moment.</i>

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:29.440
<i>I need to do whatever it 
takes to immobilize him.</i>

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.600
<b>Big Titty Teacher</b>

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.600
Seduced by Her Student

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.600
<b>The Unique Relationship Between
 a Teacher and Her Student</b>

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:31.620
<i>That's it!</i>

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:37.120
Kurage-nii, let...

00:17:37.370 --> 00:17:38.110
Let?

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:40.870
Let me borrow that adult 
video about the teacher!

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:41.860
What?

00:17:43.110 --> 00:17:44.130
Now's my chance!

00:17:45.120 --> 00:17:46.000
Shit!

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.760
The rest is up to you!

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:48.740
Got it!

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:57.050
If you won't believe him, then I'll 
force you to see the world we see!

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:05.140
Wh-What is this?

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:09.980
A Lattice Fox.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:14.180
By looking through this, even people who 
can't see the mysterious are able to see them.

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.300
Come on, the rest of you. Look.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:22.430
Toru's been seeing these the whole time.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:24.690
He's been suffering alone.

00:18:30.200 --> 00:18:32.850
You did well considering 
the shape you're in.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.920
Thanks to you.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:42.310
So, you've got a thing for teachers, huh?

00:18:42.310 --> 00:18:43.250
No!

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:50.800
I see. The mysterious and 
mysterious diseases, huh?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:54.200
And in order to cure Toru's 
mysterious disease,

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:56.690
he has to eat food containing 
medicine every day

00:18:56.690 --> 00:19:00.080
to drive out the mysterious in his stomach.

00:19:00.260 --> 00:19:03.190
Yeah. I know it's a hassle,

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:06.270
but I'd like him to come to my 
shrine every morning and evening.

00:19:07.180 --> 00:19:09.140
Toru, I'm sorry.

00:19:09.140 --> 00:19:11.220
I knew you were worried about something,

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:13.480
but I ruined your opportunity 
to tell us by teasing you.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.030
From now on, we'll listen to you.

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:19.340
If anything happens, you can lean on us.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.070
Okay.

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.600
And not him.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:26.480
What?!

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.540
Kurage, was it?

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:30.850
Have I done something to offend you?

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:32.480
You have been this whole time!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:40.480
<i>I told them, and they understood me.</i>

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:48.360
<i>Just knowing that they understand 
makes me feel better.</i>

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:51.870
You shouldn't be here.

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:55.040
You require more training.

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.510
Take him away.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:20:01.340
<i>I can't resist. I exhausted myself earlier.</i>

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:03.160
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.690
<i>I can't fight off this many guys on my own.</i>

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.630
Trust me.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.180
Lean on us.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.430
H-Help!

00:20:15.690 --> 00:20:17.220
Be quiet!

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:25.280
How dare you touch Toru 
with your filthy hands.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:36.910
<i>Pissing off this family is a super bad idea...</i>

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:42.970
<i>And so, I began visiting 
the shrine every day.</i>

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:46.540
Kuro, food's ready.

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:48.590
Thanks for the food.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:49.980
More, please.

00:20:50.260 --> 00:20:51.190
Sure thing.

00:20:54.510 --> 00:20:55.640
Excuse me...

00:20:56.460 --> 00:20:57.530
What is it?

00:20:57.530 --> 00:21:00.070
I don't like that I've 
done nothing to repay you,

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.340
so if there's anything I 
can do, I'd like to help.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:07.210
Besides, I'd like to know more about the 
mysterious and mysterious diseases, too.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.870
I'd like you to teach me about 
them during your spare time,

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:11.930
Doctor Ramune.

00:21:15.010 --> 00:21:16.120
What is it?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.830
I have an apprentice!

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:22.430
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:22.420
I'm not—

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:26.220
An apprentice! My very first apprentice!

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:26.080
Well, whatever.

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.770
Yes!

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:31.250
It's already been a year, huh?

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:33.310
Time flies, doesn't it?

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:33.970
Yes.

00:21:33.970 --> 00:21:36.510
Why did we come to the aquarium, anyway?

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:40.140
Because the deep sea fish 
exhibit is only open now.

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:46.940
Doctor?

00:23:25.570 --> 00:23:28.450
<i>I'm a grown man, you know.</i>

00:23:28.450 --> 00:23:29.800
<i>Should you be saying that?</i>

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:32.400
<i>I'll be fine on my own.</i>

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:34.680
<i>I'm so lonely, Kuro!</i>

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:37.020
Dr. Ramune -Mysterious Disease Specialist-.

00:23:37.020 --> 00:23:39.610
<i>Episode 12, "Dr. Ramune -Mysterious 
Disease Specialist-."</i>

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>Episode 12
